WEBVTT

NOTE
The SeeD field exam landing at Dollet — landing craft cross the sea to the occupied town under a dusk sky.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 13 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:03.900
A large pale moon hangs in the dark sky.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.650
Dark SeeD landing craft streak across the face of the moon, trailing wakes.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.900
A glowing blue shape glides low over the water.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.780
SeeD landing craft speed across the sea beneath an orange dusk.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.830
Hands hold a mission briefing — a map of the Dollet coast with a red arrow to the tower.

00:48.000 --> 00:53.650
SeeD soldiers run across the beach as a huge explosion erupts behind them.

00:58.000 --> 01:03.650
A landing craft races toward Dollet, the communication tower on the distant headland.

01:08.000 --> 01:12.780
It reaches the shore; the Dollet tower looms against the dusk.
